  "reason": "The strongest evidence so far is config_036, which uses scvi_n200, multiprofile, avgpool, imagenet_vit_l, and concat fusion, achieving the best validation accuracy and F1. All completed multimodal experiments used concat, so fusion type remains an untested but important design choice. config_037 keeps the best-known representation, profile setting, and aggregation fixed while changing only fusion to weighted, directly testing whether weighted fusion can improve on concat or whether concat is already sufficient. This is a high-value, one-factor exploitation of the current best direction and is more informative than changing multiple components at once."
